      "text": "Let's get a cholesterol blood test, for routine check. I'm going to order a fasting sugar test, for routine check. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Keep up regular exercise and a balanced diet. Please don't wait if new symptoms appear. That's when to be seen urgently."
